   "text": "而下雨的時候有些東西不能做。",
   "pause_before": 1
  },
  {
   "t": "narration",
   "text": "而他到家的時候，他女兒在客廳。",
   "pause_before": 2
  },
  {
   "t": "narration",
   "text": "而她那天沒有在寫東西。",
   "pause_before": 2
  },
  {
   "t": "emphasis",
   "text": "她在看手機。",
   "pause_before": 1
  },
  {
   "t": "narration",
   "text": "而桌上有一張紙。",
   "pause_before": 2
  },
  {
   "t": "speech",
   "text": "「爸。」",
   "pause_before": 3,
   "who": "daughter",
   "label_as": null
  },
  {
   "t": "speech",
   "text": "「嗯。」",
   "pause_before": 0,
   "who": "daughter",
   "label_as": null
  },
  {
   "t": "speech",
   "text": "「這個要簽。」",
   "pause_before": 0,
   "who": "daughter",
   "label_as": null
  },
  {
   "t": "narration",
   "text": "而他走過去看。",
   "pause_before": 2
  },
  {
